<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT PHILADELPHIA WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT PHILADELPHIA WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Monday at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Advanta Championship women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>8-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Virginia Ruano Pascual (Spain) 4-6</p>
<p>6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Meghann Shaugnessy (U.S.) beat Laxmi Poruri (U.S.) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) beat Radka Zrubakova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-0 6-4</p>
</text>
